 "transcript": [
  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We have been working for two years and now we have a house in the town, and we have servants and everything, and we have a good wife and she is very beautiful and we have a fine house, and the sons of rich men come and call upon us and we are very proud and we eat and drink in our house like rich men and we have servants and we do not eat with our father and we do not even call upon him often, and our father is very unhappy.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung listens silently to his son's words.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"And we have a fine house and we have a fine wife, and we have servants and we have a fine home, and we have a good house and we eat and drink like the rich men and we live well and we do not eat with our father and we do not call upon him often, and he is very unhappy.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) goes to see second son",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung sits on the bed and asks his second son.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Eldest son watches his brother.",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Well, and have you been eating well?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) nods",
  "[action] the eldest son walks with his father",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung and his eldest son walk about the house.",
  "[action] Wang Lung and his eldest son sit on the bed.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and how is my son?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son replies to his father.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I am well, father, and we are both in good health.\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"And we shall not lack for food, as I saw there was a good harvest this year.\"",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"And I have bought some land from the Old Lord,\"",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"and it is not land enough, but if the price is high I will buy more, for I have money.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son walks with his brother and father."
 ],
